description_text:
Exterior scene of a gas station.Background image included.
Polygons: 19 962Vertices: 10 508
Features:

  - 1 Camera view (1st preview);

  - Dome and V-Ray plane lights;

  - Scene objects are grouped;

  - Real-world scale objects, mm;

  - Optimized mesh (quads mostly);

  - Model is fully textured with all materials applied;

  - All map paths were stripped;

  - Optimized textures (12 maps in total);

  - Materials and renderer: V-Ray 4 (Next 2);

  - Available formats: 2017MAX, 2019FBX(2014/2015 Compitable), 2020OBJ;

  - All textures included in the archive.

The set consists of 4 vases of different designs. Vases are made under the material of ceramics and glass.In the download materials you will find a zip file with textures, formats:

  - blend.;

  - obj;

  - mtl;

  - stl;

  - fbx.

This is model is shared for free. More models you can find and download on the link below: 

https://www.cgtrader.com/designinme 

The following formats of this model are available:

  - .blend (as native);

  - .obj;

  - .stl;

  - .fbx;

  - .mtl;

  - .glb;

  - .dae;

The model has got 6890 vertices and 4134 faces. 
The original minecraft textures (256x256 resolution .png format) were used for creating materials. 
Cycles  was used for creating render images.

Fruit tree branches in summer and fall seasons.
